<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Deskutil" description="How Deskutil protects your privacy: utility inputs are processed locally in your browser and are not sent to our servers."><article class="shell page-heading prose"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Your work stays in your browser.</h1><p>Deskutil tools are designed to process your input on your device. The JSON Formatter does not send pasted JSON to a server.</p><h2>What that means</h2><p>You do not need an account. We do not receive, store, or review the content you paste into our tools. Downloads are created locally by your browser.</p><h2>Site operations</h2><p>Like most websites, our hosting provider may process basic request information needed to securely deliver the site. We do not use that information to inspect the content you enter into tools.</p></article></BaseLayout>
